<description>&lt;p&gt;Myanmar’s junta forces have intensified cross-border airstrikes, bombing a health centre in Thailand’s Tak province, homes and an IDP camp, and targeting Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, while Thai foreign minister has visited Myanmar and phoned its counterpart after border fighting injured Thai nationals. Russian operators are piloting drones for the junta on Myanmar front lines, and the United States is linking diplomatic engagement on Myanmar peace talks to access to the country’s rare-earth resources. Thailand is forging new deals with Myanmar and the United States, and two Myanmar men were arrested over a roadside attack in Thalang. The ICJ will deliver its judgment in the Rohingya genocide case against Myanmar on 19 November. 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQektPMXRENjNVbGZYbW9uOE5TdHFnWkxqTWh0bmJqLWtFUnBMQ2xSM2s2am5ra3NLdEhBMFFhYTRYd29ENUx6eDI3YjBURW1BcW5jZ0RBSkowbEplM0lwY251UzZuWEZmZng0RGVvbkYxV090RTJlaVZvUkx5LWR1aFdfYWFTbmN2T05LbmRHOGhmOW5Cci1fSW96UjMxNDFuLThmMVo4V00teDd0a2Zr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNNzI1bktEZHRBVno0UVdnWktuRFZzRExKRkIwbkJ5TlRjZjNDYk9qTGtnaUtYMnJOY0hNUjA3ZGVFY3EyZ2NiQ2dtdHRBaFc1NnY1MGtVSWdyMHduanNoMXFXRHkwb1hqaUNLVmx5ODltRWVtVXdVdDVlb09FOHFyQTRTQ21HWkx6eUJpRE9FdmFzaUg1bzlwbW9pX2U2ZGh2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV